WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.404 --> 00:00:02.331
(audience cheers)

00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:04.305
- All right, you guys
ready for Suicide Squad?

00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:07.138
(audience cheers)

00:00:09.471 --> 00:00:11.655
- Ladies and gentlemen,
the cast of Suicide Squad,

00:00:11.655 --> 00:00:12.785
let's get 'em out here!

00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:14.515
(audience applauds)

00:00:14.515 --> 00:00:17.476
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:20.309
(audience cheers)

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.931
- Suicide Squad!

00:01:15.931 --> 00:01:18.764
(audience cheers)

00:01:37.612 --> 00:01:38.620
- All right.

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.689
- Where are you going?

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:42.185
- Oh man, you're number three.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:44.112
Hey Jared, you're okay.

00:01:44.112 --> 00:01:45.006
- You know what I love?

00:01:45.006 --> 00:01:47.177
(audience cheers)

00:01:47.177 --> 00:01:48.928
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:49.761
(audience cheers)

00:01:49.761 --> 00:01:50.883
- How you doing, good to see you.

00:01:50.883 --> 00:01:51.835
- Ah, get over here.

00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:53.356
(man cheers)

00:01:53.356 --> 00:01:54.261
You'll get fired.

00:01:54.261 --> 00:01:55.094
- I love that.

00:01:55.094 --> 00:01:56.444
- Yes!

00:01:56.444 --> 00:01:57.486
- Just sayin'.

00:01:57.486 --> 00:01:59.773
(audience cheers)

00:01:59.773 --> 00:02:00.725
- Give it up!

00:02:00.725 --> 00:02:03.558
(audience cheers)

00:02:06.495 --> 00:02:07.645
- All right, I love...

00:02:07.645 --> 00:02:08.478
(man cheers)

00:02:08.478 --> 00:02:09.862
- Goodnight, everybody!

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:13.488
(audience cheers)

00:02:13.488 --> 00:02:15.772
(man laughs)

00:02:15.772 --> 00:02:18.111
- Ah, there's something, there
would have been something...

00:02:18.111 --> 00:02:18.944
(man yells)

00:02:18.944 --> 00:02:19.777
(speaker laughs)

00:02:19.777 --> 00:02:20.932
- Squad, squad, squad!

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:21.765
- What time?

00:02:21.765 --> 00:02:22.598
- Squad!

00:02:22.598 --> 00:02:23.431
- What time?

00:02:23.431 --> 00:02:24.264
- Squad!

00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:25.239
(man yells)

00:02:25.239 --> 00:02:26.714
- Squad, squad, squad!

00:02:26.714 --> 00:02:29.013
(audience cheers)

00:02:29.013 --> 00:02:31.596
- Don't do it; you can't do it.

00:02:32.693 --> 00:02:33.526
You can't do that.

